  "post_content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/P1660241.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>El sal&oacute; de la Font Seca ha acollit aquest dimecres el dinar per a pensionistes oferit per la comissi&oacute; de festes amb la col&middot;laboraci&oacute; de les tendes d&#39;Antonia i Est&iacute;baliz, i el forn de Felipo. Al final, la reina, Alba Lengua Garcia, ha repartit gorres de Caixa Rural Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660200.jpg\" alt=\"p1660200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660202.jpg\" alt=\"p1660202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660203.jpg\" alt=\"p1660203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660206.jpg\" alt=\"p1660206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660207.jpg\" alt=\"p1660207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660209.jpg\" alt=\"p1660209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660212.jpg\" alt=\"p1660212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dinarpensionistesfestesestiusuera17/p1660213.jpg\" alt=\"p1660213\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439